        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "This itinerary takes you through four distinct parts of Colombia. Start in high-altitude Bogotá and discover the legend of El Dorado, then head to the coffee region around Pereira and Salento. The next leg takes you to Medellín and Guatapé. The trip then reaches the Caribbean, where Cartagena’s old city walls give way to the Rosario Islands, with several days free to relax on the beach."
